---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import arrow from 'lucide-static/icons/arrow-up-right.svg?raw';
import sparkles from 'lucide-static/icons/sparkles.svg?raw';
const repo = 'https://github.com/isyuricunha/nery';
const expressions = [['README / introduction','Portrait or happy'],['Installation and onboarding','Happy'],['Developer tools','Coding'],['Successful task','Happy'],['Help or troubleshooting','Thinking'],['Waiting / break','Coffee or sleeping'],['Friendly empty state','With cat'],['Character presentation','Full body']];
const poses = [['portrait','Portrait',745,905],['happy','Happy',222,198],['thinking','Thinking',214,197],['coding','Coding',225,218],['coffee','Coffee',225,222],['sleeping','Sleeping',312,228],['with-cat','With cat',294,198],['fullbody','Full body',195,403]] as const;
const states = ['Idle','Running right','Running left','Waving','Jumping','Failed','Waiting for input','Working','Reviewing'];
---
<BaseLayout>
<header class="header wrap"><a class="brand" href="#main" aria-label="Nery Mizuki home"><span class="brand-mark">N<span> / </span>M</span><span>Nery Mizuki</span></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#identity">Identity</a><a href="#kit">The kit</a><a href="#pet">Live pet <span class="live-dot"></span></a><a href="#usage">Usage</a></nav><a class="source-link" href={repo}>Repository <span class="icon" set:html={arrow} /></a></header>
<main id="main">
<section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-title"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="line"></span> A LITTLE CHARACTER. A LOT OF HEART.</p><h1 id="hero-title">Nery<br />Mizuki<span class="period">.</span></h1><p class="tagline">Built to be <span class="yu-shimmer-gold">yours.</span></p><p class="hero-description">A curious companion with copper hair and a warm heart.<br class="desktop" /> Official mascot of Mnerys.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="#pet">Meet your companion <span class="icon" set:html={sparkles} /></a><a class="button" href="#kit">Explore the kit <span class="icon" set:html={arrow} /></a></div><a class="credit" href="#license">© 2026 Yuri Cunha · All rights reserved</a></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="orbit"></div><img src="/nery-mizuki-avatar.webp" alt="Nery Mizuki with copper-red hair, amber eyes and cream bows" width="128" height="157" fetchpriority="high" /><span class="art-note"><span class="live-dot"></span> YOUR FRIENDLY FACE IN MNERYS</span><span class="art-index">CHARACTER FILE / 001</span></div></section>
<div class="intro-strip"><div class="wrap"><span>Curious by nature.</span><span>Warm by design.</span><span>Always Nery.</span><span class="small-gold">OFFICIAL CHARACTER HOME ↗</span></div></div>
<section id="identity" class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / IDENTITY</p><h2>A familiar face.<br />A character of her own.</h2></div><p>Nery is the friendly face of Mnerys and Yuri Cunha’s web properties, a cute, curious member of the Mizuki family. She is a mascot, never a logo or a chatbot persona.</p></div><div class="identity-grid"><article class="card look"><p class="overline">THE CANONICAL LOOK</p><h3>Copper, charcoal<br />& a little warmth.</h3><p>Copper-red hair. Amber eyes. Cream hair bows. A dark charcoal hoodie with warm terracotta and orange accents.</p><p>Friendly 2D anime / chibi illustration, dark charcoal backgrounds and warm highlights.</p><div class="swatches">{[['#211915','Charcoal'],['#2A211D','Warm'],['#CC785C','Terracotta'],['#F0E9E3','Cream'],['#B9A195','Muted']].map(([color,label])=><span style={`--swatch:${color}`}>{label}<small>{color}</small></span>)}</div></article><article class="card"><p class="overline">KEEP HER TRUE</p><h3>The never-do list</h3><ul class="rules"><li>Never change her hair or eye color.</li><li>Never use purple brand accents on her.</li><li>Never apply generic robot motifs.</li><li>Never replace the geometric M logo with a mascot icon in a favicon, PWA, app icon or wordmark.</li><li>Never redraw or restyle her outside the approved character sheet without the rights holder’s approval.</li><li>Never claim the artwork is open-source, AGPL-3.0 or freely reusable.</li></ul></article></div><div class="expression"><div><p class="overline">THE RIGHT EXPRESSION</p><h3>A little feeling<br />for every moment.</h3><p>New poses enter the kit through this repository, versioned and changelogged. Anything produced elsewhere is not canon.</p></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><caption class="sr-only">Expression guide</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Context</th><th scope="col">Suggested expression</th></tr></thead><tbody>{expressions.map(([context,expression])=><tr><td>{context}</td><td>{expression}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div></div></section>
<section id="kit" class="section kit-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / THE APPROVED KIT</p><h2>Eight ways to be Nery.</h2></div><p>One character, a whole range of moments.<br />The original approved poses, with real transparency.</p></div><div class="gallery">{poses.map(([file,label,width,height],i)=><figure class="pose"><div class="pose-image"><img src={`/kit/nery-${file}.webp`} alt={`Nery Mizuki — ${label.toLowerCase()} pose`} width={width} height={height} loading="lazy" style={`max-width:min(100%, ${width}px)`} /></div><figcaption><span>{label}</span><small>0{i+1}</small></figcaption></figure>)}</div><div class="kit-note"><span class="overline">KIT V1.0 / NATIVE RESOLUTION</span><p>Original-size assets, never upscaled paintings. The full-body pose is <strong>195 × 403 px: never upscale it.</strong> Inspect extracted alpha edges around hair and dark clothing before large-format use.</p></div></div></section>
<section id="pet" class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / A LITTLE COMPANY</p><h2>Say hello. She’ll wave.</h2></div><p>Click Nery to say hello or select any animation below. The chosen state stays active until you change it.</p></div><div class="pet-panel"><div class="panel-top"><span><span class="live-dot"></span> LIVE PET PANEL</span><span>PETDEX / SPRITE V2</span></div><div class="pet-stage"><span class="stage-label">A MOMENT WITH NERY</span><button class="pet-hit" id="preview-hit" aria-label="Say hello to Nery"><canvas id="pet-preview" width="192" height="208" role="img" aria-label="Nery’s animated pet preview">Nery’s pet preview requires canvas support.</canvas></button><span class="stage-ground"></span><p id="pet-state" aria-live="polite">Idle</p></div><div class="pet-controls" aria-label="Pet animation states">{states.map((state,i)=><button type="button" data-state={i} aria-pressed={i===0}>{state}</button>)}</div><div class="panel-bottom"><span>9 STATES · NATIVE FRAME COUNTS · EASED TRANSITIONS</span><span>Small steps. Familiar company.</span></div></div><p class="pet-hint">She also walks along the bottom of the page. After a quiet moment, she rests. <span>Reduced motion? Nery holds a static pose.</span></p><noscript><p>The live pet needs JavaScript. Meet Nery in the approved artwork above.</p></noscript></section>
<section id="usage" class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">04 / MAKE HER AT HOME</p><h2>A thoughtful introduction.</h2></div><p>For authorized projects, bring Nery into your own surface while keeping her identity intact.</p></div><div class="usage-grid"><article><span class="step">01</span><h3>Start at the source.</h3><p>Copy assets from a <a href={`${repo}/releases`}>tagged release</a> of the official repository.</p></article><article><span class="step">02</span><h3>Keep the version.</h3><p>Record the kit version in your project, for example “Nery kit v1.0”.</p></article><article><span class="step">03</span><h3>Adapt the surface.</h3><p>Adjust placement, size and motion. Follow the <a href={`${repo}/blob/main/docs/IDENTITY.md`}>identity rules</a>; never redraw or invent features.</p></article><article><span class="step">04</span><h3>Respect the artwork.</h3><p>Never package or redistribute without express written permission. Review the <a href="#license">license</a> before adopting her.</p></article></div></section>
<section id="license" class="wrap license-section"><div class="license-card"><div><p class="eyebrow">05 / THE FINE PRINT, CLEARLY</p><h2>A character with<br />a home and a rights holder.</h2><a class="button" href={`${repo}/blob/main/assets/mascot/LICENSE.md`}>Read the full license v1.1 <span class="icon" set:html={arrow} /></a></div><div><p>Nery Mizuki is proprietary artwork. <strong>© 2026 Yuri Cunha. All rights reserved.</strong></p><p>The Nery Mizuki Proprietary Mascot Asset License v1.1 permits installation and display within an authorized Mnerys instance. The rights holder distributes the artwork through this official repository and authorizes use on Yuri Cunha’s own properties.</p><p>Third parties need express written permission for independent use, redistribution, packaging or derivative artwork. Browser delivery does not grant reuse rights.</p><p class="license-emphasis">The art is not AGPL. The Mnerys software license is separate and does not extend to Nery’s artwork.</p></div></div></section>
</main>
<footer class="wrap footer"><a class="brand" href="#main"><span class="brand-mark">N<span> / </span>M</span><span>Nery Mizuki<small>Built to be yours.</small></span></a><div class="footer-links"><a href={repo}>GitHub ↗</a><a href="https://gitlab.com/isyuricunha/nery">GitLab ↗</a><a href="https://git.yuricunha.com/isyuricunha/nery">YuGit ↗</a></div><a class="credit" href="#license">© 2026 Yuri Cunha. All rights reserved.</a></footer>
<div class="walker-shell"><button id="walker-hit" aria-label="Say hello to Nery walking along the page"><canvas id="pet-walker" width="96" height="104" role="img" aria-label="Nery, your page companion">Nery’s page companion</canvas></button></div>
<script>import '../scripts/pet';</script>
</BaseLayout>
